WEBVTT

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.351
and no human being has ever
been down there to film them

00:06:31.375 --> 00:06:32.643
or take samples.

00:06:32.667 --> 00:06:34.518
And so this is extraordinary for us --

00:06:34.542 --> 00:06:36.893
(Applause)

00:06:36.917 --> 00:06:38.226
So what we are hoping --

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.601
the main objective of our mission
is to build this tool.

00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:43.268
This tool is a door,

00:06:43.292 --> 00:06:44.601
because with this tool,

00:06:44.625 --> 00:06:46.809
we'll be able to make
more of them potentially

00:06:46.833 --> 00:06:49.184
and take scientists down
to do thousands of dives,

00:06:49.208 --> 00:06:51.434
to open that door to exploration

00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:54.518
and find things that we
had no idea even existed.

00:06:54.542 --> 00:06:59.434
DB: And so more people have been
to space than the bottom of the ocean.

00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:01.101
You're one of three.